Yeah.  Kill a dragon and see if dragon scales are left behind.  If so,
wear them.  This gives you the intrinsic appropriate to the dragon type,
but it's not much for AC.  Now read a scroll of enchant armor.  Presto,
base AC 1 dragon scale mail.  Light, too.  What all the adventurers will
be wearing in Paris this fall.

Sometimes it's easier just to wish for it.  I've never found dragon
scale mail sitting around, but maybe a ghost could have some.  (My
characters with good stuff never seem to make bones files.  :-< )

And if you're wishing, I think you want gray.  It's the trendiest
color.  And, more importantly, the most difficult intrinsic to
acquire, unless you're playing a wizard.

